//@version=6
// ============================================================================
// IDX ANALYZER PRO [IZA] v6 — Unified (fresh rebuild)
// ============================================================================
// One decision-support indicator built by merging and upgrading three prior
// scripts so they complement each other instead of duplicating/contradicting:
//   • "IDX Analyzer PRO [IZA+FEELS]"      — ATR-adaptive Double Top/Bottom and
//                                            Head & Shoulders / Inverse H&S
//                                            engine with a forming -> confirmed
//                                            -> resolved lifecycle, off a
//                                            shared pivot/zigzag store.
//   • "IDX Analyzer PRO v3.2 Elite [IZA]" — independent Bull/Bear scoring,
//                                            ADX/MTF/market-regime context,
//                                            structural entry/stop/TP plan.
//   • "AiTrend Pattern Matrix for kNN Forecasting" — (c) aibitcointrend,
//                                            licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
//                                            (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/).
//                                            k-nearest-neighbor candle-shape
//                                            forecaster; ported here with its
//                                            math unchanged, restyled to this
//                                            script's palette, and folded into
//                                            the Bull/Bear score. This clause
//                                            must stay attached under the
//                                            license's Attribution/ShareAlike
//                                            terms if you redistribute this
//                                            file — personal/non-commercial
//                                            use only for the AI module.
//
// WHAT THIS VERSION ADDS ON TOP OF BOTH ORIGINALS
//   • The trading-plan scorer (v3.2 half) now reads its pattern bias/target
//     straight from the lifecycle engine's own validated, confirmed pattern
//     (v4 half) instead of re-detecting patterns a second time with looser
//     rules — one source of truth, no bias between the two halves.
//   • A dedicated Accumulation/Distribution read (Chaikin money-flow) is
//     graded by BOTH traded volume (RVOL) and price velocity (rate of
//     change), so "Akumulasi/Distribusi Kuat" means real volume behind a
//     real price move, not just one or the other.
//   • Support, Resistance, TP1, TP2 and Cut Loss are each drawn in their own
//     color (orange / green / light blue / dark blue / red) as a soft
//     gradient band (a solid center line fading to a lighter tint of the
//     SAME hue at the edges — Pine has no true per-pixel gradient, this is
//     the closest equivalent), all at a fixed 50% transparency, projected
//     forward from the live bar for a configurable number of weeks (2 by
//     default) — never into the past.
//   • "ENTRY - BUY <price>" / "EXIT - SELL <price>" (and, if short notation
//     is enabled, "ENTRY - SELL" / "EXIT - BUY") are stamped as a light
//     green / red gradient AREA exactly on the trigger candle — not just a
//     text label — driven by the same candlestick-pattern + score engine
//     that grades every bar.
//   • No tables anywhere. Every figure that used to live in a table (trend,
//     phase, pattern, grade, score, pattern win-rate) is folded into one
//     compact multi-line status label on the chart.
//   • One font family, one text size, everywhere. Label/box text color is
//     chosen automatically (black or white) for contrast against whichever
//     of the five level colors it sits on.
//   • No hardcoded ticker list or watchlist gate of any kind. The engine
//     always evaluates syminfo.tickerid — add this to ANY chart/symbol in
//     any watchlist and it runs immediately, no code edits.
//
// This is a technical-analysis tool to support discretionary decisions.
// Scores, grades and phase reads describe historical tendencies on THIS
// chart, not guarantees of what happens next.
// ============================================================================
indicator("IDX Analyzer PRO [IZA] v6 Unified", shorttitle = "IDXA-PROv6", overlay = true, max_lines_count = 400, max_labels_count = 350, max_boxes_count = 400, max_bars_back = 3000)

// ============================================================================
// INPUTS
// ============================================================================
gTrend = "01. Trend & Regime"
maFastLen = input.int(20, "MA Fast (EMA)", minval = 2, group = gTrend)
maMidLen  = input.int(50, "MA Medium (EMA)", minval = 5, group = gTrend)
maSlowLen = input.int(200, "MA Major (SMA)", minval = 20, group = gTrend)
slopeBars = input.int(5, "MA Slope Lookback", minval = 1, group = gTrend)
diLen     = input.int(14, "DMI Length", minval = 5, group = gTrend)
adxSmooth = input.int(14, "ADX Smoothing", minval = 5, group = gTrend)
adxTrend  = input.float(20.0, "ADX Trending Threshold", minval = 10, step = 1, group = gTrend)
adxStrong = input.float(28.0, "ADX Strong Trend Threshold", minval = 15, step = 1, group = gTrend)

gStructure = "02. Structure & Swing Pivots"
pivLen        = input.int(5, "Swing Pivot Size (bars L/R)", minval = 2, maxval = 40, group = gStructure, tooltip = "One shared pivot width feeds swing structure, clustered S/R, AND the pattern engine below — all three read the exact same swing points.")
maxPivots     = input.int(30, "Max Stored Pivots", minval = 10, maxval = 60, group = gStructure)
useTrendGate  = input.bool(true, "Require Prior Trend Before A Pattern", group = gStructure, tooltip = "Rejects a Double Top/Bottom or H&S/iH&S not preceded by a genuine trend. Cuts false signals from sideways chop.")
trendLookback = input.int(20, "Trend-Gate Lookback (bars)", minval = 5, maxval = 100, group = gStructure, active = useTrendGate)
trendGatePct  = input.float(2.0, "Min Prior Trend For A Pattern (%)", minval = 0.0, maxval = 20.0, step = 0.5, group = gStructure, active = useTrendGate) / 100

gLevel = "03. Support / Resistance & Risk"
srWindowDays = input.int(10, "S/R Window (trading days, ~1-2 weeks)", minval = 3, maxval = 30, group = gLevel, tooltip = "Support/Resistance/TP1/TP2/Cut Loss are read off swing structure + MA within roughly this many trading days back, auto-converted to bars for whatever timeframe you're on, so the range stays short and decision-ready instead of scaling with chart history.")
atrLen       = input.int(14, "ATR Length", minval = 2, group = gLevel)
srBreakoutBuf= input.float(0.20, "Breakout Buffer (ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = gLevel)
clusterATR   = input.float(0.45, "S/R Cluster Width (ATR)", minval = 0.10, step = 0.05, group = gLevel)
zoneATR      = input.float(0.30, "Entry Zone Width (ATR)", minval = 0.05, step = 0.05, group = gLevel)
stopATR      = input.float(0.35, "Stop Buffer (ATR)", minval = 0.05, step = 0.05, group = gLevel)
minRR        = input.float(1.8, "Minimum R:R", minval = 0.5, step = 0.1, group = gLevel)
maxExtension = input.float(2.0, "Max Distance From MA Fast (ATR)", minval = 0.5, step = 0.25, group = gLevel)
retestBars   = input.int(8, "Breakout Retest Window (bars)", minval = 2, maxval = 30, group = gLevel)

gPattern = "04. Chart Pattern Engine"
patTolATR    = input.float(0.5, "Level Tolerance (ATR)", minval = 0.1, maxval = 2, step = 0.1, group = gPattern, tooltip = "How close two tops, two bottoms, or two shoulders must be to count as equal.")
patBufATR    = input.float(0.15, "Neckline Break Buffer (ATR)", minval = 0, maxval = 1, step = 0.05, group = gPattern)
confMode     = input.string("Close", "Neckline Break Confirms On", options = ["Close", "Wick"], group = gPattern, tooltip = "Close: bar must CLOSE beyond the neckline (strict). Wick: an intrabar pierce confirms (looser).")
voidTolATR   = input.float(0.0, "Extra Invalidation Room (ATR)", minval = 0, maxval = 3, step = 0.25, group = gPattern)
maxWaitBars  = input.int(60, "Confirm Within (bars)", minval = 10, maxval = 300, group = gPattern)
trackBars    = input.int(120, "Track Outcome For (bars)", minval = 20, maxval = 500, group = gPattern)
maxKeepPatterns = input.int(8, "Patterns Kept On Chart", minval = 1, maxval = 20, group = gPattern)
minDepthATR  = input.float(1.0, "Minimum Pattern Depth (ATR)", minval = 0.25, step = 0.25, group = gPattern)
minStat      = input.int(1, "Min Samples For Win-Rate Text", minval = 1, maxval = 20, group = gPattern)
showDT  = input.bool(true, "Double Top", group = gPattern)
showDB  = input.bool(true, "Double Bottom", group = gPattern)
showHS  = input.bool(true, "Head & Shoulders", group = gPattern)
showIHS = input.bool(true, "Inverse H&S", group = gPattern)
dblMode = input.string("Any", "Second Peak / Bottom", options = ["Any", "Weaker"], group = gPattern, tooltip = "Weaker: only take a Double Top whose 2nd peak isn't higher than the 1st (and mirrored for Double Bottom) — classic momentum-failure form.")

gConfirm = "05. Confirmation, Volume & Liquidity"
volAvgLen    = input.int(20, "Volume Average Length", minval = 5, group = gConfirm)
breakoutRVOL = input.float(1.40, "Breakout Minimum RVOL", minval = 0.5, step = 0.1, group = gConfirm)
minRVOL      = input.float(0.80, "Minimum Setup RVOL", minval = 0.2, step = 0.1, group = gConfirm)
rsiLen       = input.int(14, "RSI Length", minval = 2, group = gConfirm)
mtfMode      = input.string("Auto", "Higher Timeframe Mode", options = ["Auto", "Manual"], group = gConfirm, tooltip = "Auto: picks a wider timeframe automatically from the chart's own timeframe (intraday -> Daily, Daily -> Weekly, Weekly/Monthly -> Monthly) for a more accurate trend read regardless of zoom. Manual: use the fixed timeframe below.")
mtfManual    = input.timeframe("W", "Manual Higher Timeframe", group = gConfirm, active = mtfMode == "Manual")
useMarket    = input.bool(true, "Use Market Index Regime", group = gConfirm)
marketSymbol = input.symbol("IDX:COMPOSITE", "Market Symbol", group = gConfirm)
useSector    = input.bool(false, "Use Sector/Benchmark Relative Strength", group = gConfirm)
sectorSymbol = input.symbol("IDX:COMPOSITE", "Sector/Benchmark Symbol", group = gConfirm)
useLiquidity = input.bool(true, "Use Liquidity Filter", group = gConfirm)
minValueM    = input.float(500.0, "Min Avg Traded Value (quote ccy, millions/day)", minval = 0.0, step = 50, group = gConfirm)

gAD = "06. Accumulation / Distribution"
cmfLen  = input.int(20, "Money Flow (CMF-style) Length", minval = 5, group = gAD)
veloLen = input.int(10, "Price Velocity Length (ROC bars)", minval = 3, maxval = 50, group = gAD)

gTrendLine = "07. Long Trend Projection"
showTrendLine     = input.bool(true, "Show Long Trend Projection Line", group = gTrendLine)
trendLineLen      = input.int(100, "Trend Line Lookback (bars)", minval = 20, maxval = 500, group = gTrendLine)
trendLineFwdWeeks = input.int(4, "Project Forward (weeks)", minval = 1, maxval = 12, group = gTrendLine)

gAI = "08. AI Forecast (kNN Pattern Matching)"
showAIForecast   = input.bool(true, "Show AI Forecast (kNN)", group = gAI, tooltip = "Ports 'AiTrend Pattern Matrix for kNN Forecasting' (c) aibitcointrend, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — finds the most similar historical candle pattern via k-nearest-neighbors and projects its shape forward, restyled to this script's visual language and folded into the Bull/Bear score for consistency.")
aiPatternLen     = input.int(20, "AI: Pattern Length", minval = 4, group = gAI)
aiDictSize       = input.int(20, "AI: Dictionary Size", minval = 10, group = gAI, tooltip = "Also controls how many historical patterns are searchable for the shape overlay — kept well above 10 so the nearest-match lookup isn't degenerate.")
aiHorizon        = input.int(2, "AI: Prediction Horizon (bars)", minval = 1, maxval = 100, group = gAI)
aiEmaLen         = input.int(14, "AI: Smoothing Lookback", minval = 2, group = gAI)
aiNeighbors      = input.int(2, "AI: # Of Neighbors", minval = 1, maxval = 32, group = gAI)
aiAtrMult        = input.float(2.0, "AI: ATR Multiplier", minval = 0.1, step = 0.1, group = gAI)
aiPredFilterLen  = input.int(5, "AI: Prediction EMA Filter", minval = 0, group = gAI)
aiRegimeLookback = input.int(30, "AI: Regime Bands Lookback", minval = 5, group = gAI)
aiSwingThreshATR = input.float(0.15, "AI: Swing/Neutral Threshold (ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = gAI, tooltip = "A projected bar (or the overall projection) whose midpoint barely moves is classified SWING (orange) instead of positive/negative.")

gSignal = "09. Signal Quality & Plan"
setupThreshold   = input.float(60, "Setup Score", minval = 40, maxval = 90, step = 1, group = gSignal)
confirmThreshold = input.float(72, "Confirmed Score", minval = 50, maxval = 95, step = 1, group = gSignal)
primeThreshold   = input.float(82, "A+ Prime Score", minval = 60, maxval = 100, step = 1, group = gSignal)
minScoreEdge     = input.float(12, "Minimum Bull/Bear Score Edge", minval = 0, maxval = 40, step = 1, group = gSignal)
enableShort      = input.bool(false, "Enable Short Entry/Exit Notation", group = gSignal, tooltip = "OFF (default): long-only, matching cash-equity trading — only ENTRY-BUY / EXIT-SELL. ON: also shows ENTRY-SELL / EXIT-BUY.")
planWeeks        = input.int(2, "Project Support/Resistance/TP/Cut Loss Forward (weeks)", minval = 1, maxval = 8, group = gSignal)
markerLookbackDays = input.int(30, "Show Entry/Exit Candle Markers For Last (days)", minval = 1, maxval = 180, group = gSignal)

gDisplay = "10. Display"
showStatusLabel      = input.bool(true, "Status Label (no tables, all on chart)", group = gDisplay)
showLevelZones       = input.bool(true, "Support/Resistance/TP1/TP2/Cut Loss Zones", group = gDisplay)
showEntryZoneToday   = input.bool(true, "Today's Entry Zone (projected forward)", group = gDisplay)
showPatternShape     = input.bool(true, "Pattern Shape (confirmed + live forming preview)", group = gDisplay)
showPatternOutcomes  = input.bool(true, "Pattern Outcome Tags (target/invalid)", group = gDisplay)
showEntryExitMarkers = input.bool(true, "Entry-Buy / Exit-Sell Candle Markers", group = gDisplay)
showCandleTags       = input.bool(false, "Candlestick Pattern Tags (marker window)", group = gDisplay, tooltip = "OFF by default to keep the chart clean — turn on only if you want every swing-relevant Engulfing/Doji/Marubozu/etc. named directly on the bar.")

gStyle = "11. Style — Fonts & Colors"
bullCol     = input.color(#089981, "Bullish Bias Color", group = gStyle)
bearCol     = input.color(#f23645, "Bearish Bias Color", group = gStyle)
neutralCol  = input.color(#f0a020, "Neutral/Forming Color", group = gStyle)
colSupport  = input.color(color.orange, "Support Line (Orange)", group = gStyle)
colResist   = input.color(#43A047, "Resistance Line (Green)", group = gStyle)
colTP1      = input.color(#4FC3F7, "TP1 Line (Light Blue)", group = gStyle)
colTP2      = input.color(#0D47A1, "TP2 Line (Dark Blue)", group = gStyle)
colCutloss  = input.color(#FF1744, "Cut Loss Line (Red)", group = gStyle)
colBuyArea  = input.color(#66BB6A, "Entry-Buy Area (Light Green)", group = gStyle)
colSellArea = input.color(#EF5350, "Exit-Sell Area (Red)", group = gStyle)

gAIColor = "12. AI Forecast Colors"
aiColorUp      = input.color(#089981, "AI Forecast — Up (Naik)", group = gAIColor, tooltip = "Used for BOTH the per-bar dashed prediction line and the direction arrow when the AI forecast's midpoint moves up.")
aiColorNeutral = input.color(#f0a020, "AI Forecast — Swing/Neutral", group = gAIColor)
aiColorDown    = input.color(#f23645, "AI Forecast — Down (Turun)", group = gAIColor)

gAnomaly = "13. Anomaly, Trap & Gradual Accumulation/Distribution"
anomalyLookback      = input.int(3, "Anomaly: Short-Term Price Lookback (bars)", minval = 1, maxval = 10, group = gAnomaly, tooltip = "Compares price now vs this many bars back to catch a sudden spike/drop — 'dalam waktu singkat'.")
anomalyMoveMult      = input.float(2.0, "Anomaly: Move Threshold (ATR multiple)", minval = 0.5, step = 0.25, group = gAnomaly)
anomalyMaxRVOL       = input.float(0.70, "Anomaly: Max RVOL (below this = suspicious)", minval = 0.1, step = 0.05, group = gAnomaly, tooltip = "A big price move on THIN volume reads as a phantom bid / false breakout trap rather than genuine participation.")
gradualAccumMinRVOL  = input.float(0.90, "Gradual Accumulation: Min RVOL", minval = 0.1, step = 0.05, group = gAnomaly, tooltip = "'Volume naik atau konstan' — at or above average, not a spike.")
gradualDistMinRVOL   = input.float(1.10, "Gradual Distribution: Min RVOL", minval = 0.1, step = 0.05, group = gAnomaly, tooltip = "'Volume cukup besar' — distinctly above average.")
showAnomalyMarkers   = input.bool(true, "Show Anomaly-Trap / Gradual Accum-Dist Markers", group = gAnomaly)

txtSize = 9
const string TXT_FONT = font.family_monospace
const int T50 = 80
const int T_SIGNAL = 70
const int T_AI_LINE = 20
const int T_AI_ARROW = 60
const int T_ANOMALY = 60
const int TGT_LINE_BARS = 40
const string BOLD_ENTRY_BUY  = "𝗘𝗡𝗧𝗥𝗬-𝗕𝗨𝗬"
const string BOLD_EXIT_SELL  = "𝗘𝗫𝗜𝗧-𝗦𝗘𝗟𝗟"
const string BOLD_ENTRY_SELL = "𝗘𝗡𝗧𝗥𝗬-𝗦𝗘𝗟𝗟"
const string BOLD_EXIT_BUY   = "𝗘𝗫𝗜𝗧-𝗕𝗨𝗬"
const string BOLD_ANOMALI_TRAP        = "𝗔𝗻𝗼𝗺𝗮𝗹𝗶 - 𝗧𝗿𝗮𝗽"
const string BOLD_AKUMULASI_BERTAHAP  = "𝗔𝗸𝘂𝗺𝘂𝗹𝗮𝘀𝗶 𝗕𝗲𝗿𝘁𝗮𝗵𝗮𝗽"
const string BOLD_DISTRIBUSI_BERTAHAP = "𝗗𝗶𝘀𝘁𝗿𝗶𝗯𝘂𝘀𝗶 𝗕𝗲𝗿𝘁𝗮𝗵𝗮𝗽"
const string BOLD_POTENSI_NAIK        = "𝗣𝗼𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘀𝗶 𝗡𝗮𝗶𝗸"
const string BOLD_POTENSI_TURUN       = "𝗣𝗼𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘀𝗶 𝗧𝘂𝗿𝘂𝗻"
const string BOLD_BERTAHAP_NAIK       = "𝗕𝗲𝗿𝘁𝗮𝗵𝗮𝗽 𝗡𝗮𝗶𝗸"
const string BOLD_BERTAHAP_TURUN      = "𝗕𝗲𝗿𝘁𝗮𝗵𝗮𝗽 𝗧𝘂𝗿𝘂𝗻"

// ============================================================================
// HELPERS
// ============================================================================
f_fmt(float x) => na(x) ? "—" : str.tostring(x, format.mintick)
f_clamp(float x, float lo, float hi) => math.max(lo, math.min(hi, x))

// Tint a base color toward white by fraction t (0 = full hue, 1 = white),
// ALWAYS at fixed 50% transparency — this is how "gradient area" and "all at
// 50% transparency" are satisfied together: hue/lightness varies, alpha never does.
f_tintA(color c, float t, int a) =>
    rr = int(math.round(color.r(c) + (255 - color.r(c)) * t))
    gg = int(math.round(color.g(c) + (255 - color.g(c)) * t))
    bb = int(math.round(color.b(c) + (255 - color.b(c)) * t))
    color.rgb(rr, gg, bb, a)

f_tint(color c, float t) => f_tintA(c, t, T50)

// All notation text uses fixed 80%-opaque black per user spec, regardless of
// the background hue underneath (backgrounds themselves sit at 80% transparency).
f_textOn(color c) =>
    color.new(color.black, 20)

f_boldDigit(string c) =>
    c == "0" ? "𝟬" : c == "1" ? "𝟭" : c == "2" ? "𝟮" : c == "3" ? "𝟯" : c == "4" ? "𝟰" :
     c == "5" ? "𝟱" : c == "6" ? "𝟲" : c == "7" ? "𝟳" : c == "8" ? "𝟴" : c == "9" ? "𝟵" : c

f_boldNum(string s) =>
    out = ""
    for i = 0 to str.length(s) - 1
        out := out + f_boldDigit(str.substring(s, i, i + 1))
    out

f_grade(float score, float rr, bool liquid, bool confirmed) =>
    not confirmed ? (score >= setupThreshold ? "B — WAIT" : "D — NO TRADE") :
     score >= primeThreshold and rr >= 2.0 and liquid ? "A+ — PRIME" :
     score >= confirmThreshold and rr >= minRR ? "A — HIGH QUALITY" :
     score >= setupThreshold ? "B — TRADABLE" : "C — SPECULATIVE"

// ============================================================================
// CORE CALCULATIONS
// ============================================================================
ma20  = ta.ema(close, maFastLen)
ma50  = ta.ema(close, maMidLen)
ma200 = ta.sma(close, maSlowLen)
atr   = ta.atr(atrLen)
atrPct= close != 0 ? atr / close * 100 : 0.0
tfSecondsForZones = timeframe.in_seconds()
rsi   = ta.rsi(close, rsiLen)
avgVol= ta.sma(volume, volAvgLen)
rvol  = avgVol > 0 ? volume / avgVol : 0.0
avgValueM = ta.sma(volume * close, volAvgLen) / 1000000.0
liquidityOK = not useLiquidity or avgValueM >= minValueM
closeLocation = high != low ? (close - low) / (high - low) : 0.5
[plusDI, minusDI, adx] = ta.dmi(diLen, adxSmooth)

ma20Up  = ma20 > ma20[slopeBars]
ma50Up  = ma50 > ma50[slopeBars]
ma200Up = ma200 > ma200[slopeBars]
strongBullTrend = close > ma20 and ma20 > ma50 and ma50 > ma200 and ma20Up and ma50Up and ma200Up
bullTrend = close > ma20 and ma20 > ma50 and ma20Up
strongBearTrend = close < ma20 and ma20 < ma50 and ma50 < ma200 and not ma20Up and not ma50Up and not ma200Up
bearTrend = close < ma20 and ma20 < ma50 and not ma20Up
trendBias = strongBullTrend ? 2 : bullTrend ? 1 : strongBearTrend ? -2 : bearTrend ? -1 : 0
trendText = trendBias == 2 ? "STRONG BULLISH" : trendBias == 1 ? "BULLISH" : trendBias == -2 ? "STRONG BEARISH" : trendBias == -1 ? "BEARISH" : "SIDEWAYS/TRANSISI"
regimeText = adx >= adxStrong ? "STRONG TREND" : adx >= adxTrend ? "TRENDING" : "RANGE / WEAK"

// ── Long trend projection — a linear-regression line over a much longer
// lookback than the 2-week S/R/TP/CutLoss zones, projected further forward,
// colored by its own slope so its direction reads at a glance. ──
trendLineReg0    = ta.linreg(close, trendLineLen, 0)
trendLineRegPrev = ta.linreg(close, trendLineLen, trendLineLen - 1)
trendLineSlope   = (trendLineReg0 - trendLineRegPrev) / (trendLineLen - 1)

// ── Accumulation / Distribution — Chaikin-style money flow, graded by BOTH
//    traded volume (RVOL) and price velocity (rate of change), per the
//    "berdasarkan volume transaksi dan kecepatan pergerakan" requirement. ──
mfm = (high - low) != 0 ? ((close - low) - (high - close)) / (high - low) : 0.0
mfv = mfm * volume
cmf = math.sum(mfv, cmfLen) / math.sum(volume, cmfLen)
velocity = ta.roc(close, veloLen)
volHot  = rvol >= breakoutRVOL
veloHot = math.abs(velocity) >= atrPct * 1.5
phaseBias = cmf >= 0.05 ? 1 : cmf <= -0.05 ? -1 : 0
phaseStrength = volHot and veloHot ? " KUAT (Vol+Speed)" : (volHot or veloHot) ? " SEDANG" : ""
phaseText = phaseBias == 1 ? "AKUMULASI" + phaseStrength : phaseBias == -1 ? "DISTRIBUSI" + phaseStrength : "NETRAL"

// ── Anomaly/Trap & Gradual Accumulation/Distribution — bandarmology reads.
// Anomaly: a big short-term price move (phantom bid / false breakout style)
// riding on THIN volume — a spike with no real participation behind it, the
// classic trap setup. Gradual Accumulation/Distribution: CMF money-flow
// direction (phaseBias) confirmed by at-or-above-average volume while price
// itself is NOT moving fast (not veloHot) — the "diam-diam" (quiet) buying
// or selling described in the brief. Continuation bias is symmetric: money
// flowing IN projects NAIK, money flowing OUT projects TURUN, regardless of
// what price has already done — that's what makes it "bertahap" (gradual/
// still unfolding) rather than a lagging confirmation. ──
anomalyPriceMove = math.abs(close - close[anomalyLookback])
isAnomalyBigMove = anomalyPriceMove > atr * anomalyMoveMult
isAnomalyLowVol  = rvol < anomalyMaxRVOL
isAnomalyTrap    = isAnomalyBigMove and isAnomalyLowVol
anomalyWasUp     = close > close[anomalyLookback]
anomalyTrapNew   = isAnomalyTrap and not isAnomalyTrap[1]

gradualAccum    = phaseBias == 1 and rvol >= gradualAccumMinRVOL and not veloHot
gradualDist     = phaseBias == -1 and rvol >= gradualDistMinRVOL and not veloHot
gradualAccumNew = gradualAccum and not gradualAccum[1]
gradualDistNew  = gradualDist and not gradualDist[1]

// ── Support/Resistance/Entry/Stop/TP tightness — progressive, not a fixed
// step-function of timeframe alone. A continuous log-scale base (no hard
// jumps between 1h/4h/1D/1W) is then adapted by CURRENT trend conviction
// (ADX + MA-stack) and price velocity, so the range narrows automatically
// when the move is strong/directional (less bias, less unnecessary width)
// and only widens back out in a genuine sideways/choppy regime. Every input
// (close, atr, adx, trendBias, velocity) recalculates on every tick — the
// realtime (unconfirmed) bar included — so all levels drawn from this stay
// live with price, never frozen to the last closed bar. ──
tfBaseTightness = tfSecondsForZones > 0 ? f_clamp(-0.460 + 0.1172 * math.log(tfSecondsForZones), 0.40, 1.45) : 0.85
trendConvictionFactor = strongBullTrend or strongBearTrend ? 0.82 : (bullTrend or bearTrend) ? 0.95 : 1.15
adxRegimeFactor = adx >= adxStrong ? 0.90 : adx <= adxTrend * 0.6 ? 1.10 : 1.0
veloAdaptFactor = veloHot ? 0.90 : 1.0
tfTightness = f_clamp(tfBaseTightness * trendConvictionFactor * adxRegimeFactor * veloAdaptFactor, 0.35, 1.25)
effClusterATR = clusterATR * tfTightness
effZoneATR = zoneATR * tfTightness
effStopATR = stopATR * tfTightness
// Support/Resistance/TP/CutLoss fallback lookback, converted from a fixed
// number of TRADING DAYS to bars for the current timeframe, so a 1-2 week
// read stays 1-2 weeks whether the chart is 2h, Daily, or anything else.
// The extended (x2) structural window used for further TP2 targets is itself
// pulled in when the trend is strongly convicted, so a strong trend's TP2
// doesn't drift out to a stale, overly wide structural level.
srLenAdaptive = tfSecondsForZones > 0 ? math.max(5, int(math.round(srWindowDays * 24 * 60 * 60 / tfSecondsForZones))) : 10
srLenAdaptive2Mult = strongBullTrend or strongBearTrend ? 1.4 : 1.8

// ============================================================================
// AI FORECAST (kNN Pattern Matching) — ported from "AiTrend Pattern Matrix for
// kNN Forecasting" (c) aibitcointrend, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Finds the historical
// candle pattern most similar to the current one (by body/range/wick shape,
// ATR-normalized) via k-nearest-neighbors, and predicts price aiHorizon bars
// ahead from the weighted outcome of its neighbors. The visual shape overlay
// and directional arrow are restyled below to this script's palette/rules;
// the underlying kNN math is unchanged from the original.
// ============================================================================
enum aiDictInput
    crange = "crange"
    body = "body"
    wick_low = "wick_low"
    wick_high = "wick_high"

enum aiHistInput
    hhigh = "hhigh"
    hlow = "hlow"

enum aiKnnWeighting
    distance = "distance"
    average = "average"

var array<float>  aiY  = array.new<float>()
var matrix<float>  aiD  = matrix.new<float>()
var matrix<float>  aiD2 = matrix.new<float>()
var matrix<float>  aiD3 = matrix.new<float>()
var matrix<float>  aiD4 = matrix.new<float>()
var matrix<float>  aiH  = matrix.new<float>()
var matrix<float>  aiL  = matrix.new<float>()

aiYSrc = ta.ema(close, aiEmaLen)
aiNTotal = aiHorizon + aiPatternLen
const int AI_ATR_LEN = 100
aiAtrBands = ta.atr(AI_ATR_LEN)
var float aiConf = na
var float aiNearestNeighbor = na
var int   aiNBars = 0
var float aiLMin = na
var float aiHMax = na
var float aiMMid = na
var bool  aiYHatTrend = false
var float aiYHat = na
var float aiYHatLine = na
var float aiYHatSmooth = na

f_aiUpdateDictionary(D, input_type) =>
    x = array.new<float>(aiNTotal)
    for i = 0 to aiNTotal - 1
        if input_type == aiDictInput.body
            array.set(x, -(i + 1), close[i] - open[i])
        else if input_type == aiDictInput.crange
            array.set(x, -(i + 1), high[i] - low[i])
        else if input_type == aiDictInput.wick_low
            array.set(x, -(i + 1), math.min(close[i], open[i]) - low[i])
        else if input_type == aiDictInput.wick_high
            array.set(x, -(i + 1), high[i] - math.max(close[i], open[i]))
    x_current = array.slice(x, aiNTotal - aiPatternLen, aiNTotal)
    x_prev = array.slice(x, 0, aiPatternLen)
    x_current_normed = matrix.new<float>(1, array.size(x_current), 0.0)
    for i = 0 to array.size(x_current) - 1
        matrix.set(x_current_normed, 0, i, array.get(x_current, i) / aiAtrBands)
    x_prev_normed = array.new<float>(array.size(x_prev), 0.0)
    for i = 0 to array.size(x_prev) - 1
        array.set(x_prev_normed, i, array.get(x_prev, i) / aiAtrBands)
    if D.rows() >= aiDictSize
        D.remove_row(0)
    D.add_row(D.rows(), x_prev_normed)
    x_current_normed

f_aiUpdateHistorical(D, input_type) =>
    x = array.new<float>(aiNTotal)
    for i = 0 to aiNTotal - 1
        if input_type == aiHistInput.hhigh
            array.set(x, -(i + 1), high[i])
        else
            array.set(x, -(i + 1), low[i])
    x_seg = array.slice(x, 0, aiPatternLen)
    if D.rows() >= aiDictSize
        D.remove_row(0)
    D.add_row(D.rows(), x_seg)

f_aiRunQuery(x1, x2, x3, x4, D1, D2, D3, D4) =>
    dist = array.new<float>(D1.rows(), 0.0)
    for i = 0 to D1.rows() - 1
        sum = 0.0
        diff1 = x1.diff(D1.submatrix(i, i + 1)).row(0)
        diff2 = x2.diff(D2.submatrix(i, i + 1)).row(0)
        diff3 = x3.diff(D3.submatrix(i, i + 1)).row(0)
        diff4 = x4.diff(D4.submatrix(i, i + 1)).row(0)
        for j = 0 to aiPatternLen - 1
            sum += math.pow(diff1.get(j), 2) * .25 + math.pow(diff2.get(j), 2) * .25 + math.pow(diff3.get(j), 2) * .25 + math.pow(diff4.get(j), 2) * .25
        dist.set(i, math.sqrt(sum))
    dist

f_aiKNN(dist, n_neighbors, weighting_type) =>
    idx = dist.sort_indices()
    dist_sum = 0.0
    up_count = 0
    down_count = 0
    n = math.min(n_neighbors, idx.size())
    for i = 0 to n - 1
        dist_sum += dist.get(idx.get(i))
        if aiY.get(idx.get(i)) > 0
            up_count += 1
        else
            down_count += 1
    avg = 0.0
    if weighting_type == aiKnnWeighting.distance
        for i = 0 to n - 1
            avg += aiY.get(idx.get(i)) * (n > 1 ? (1 - (dist.get(idx.get(i)) / dist_sum)) : 1)
    else if weighting_type == aiKnnWeighting.average
        for i = 0 to n - 1
            avg += aiY.get(idx.get(i))
        avg /= n
    [avg, math.max(up_count, down_count) / n, idx.get(0)]

// ── AI Forecast tracking & confirmation — each committed forecast is a
// "target sementara" (provisional target): drawn once when made, left fixed
// (not re-jittered every tick) until real price actually reaches its target
// bar, at which point it is checked against what really happened, stamped
// ✓ TRUE (green) or ✕ FALSE (red), and faded to a grey 40%-transparent
// "footprint". A new forecast begins immediately the moment the old one
// resolves, so a live forecast is always being tracked in parallel. ──
type AiFcast
    int         bornBar
    int         targetBar
    float       startMid
    int         dir
    bool        resolved
    array<box>  boxes
    line        arrowLn
    line        lnTop
    line        lnMid
    line        lnBot
    label       resultLbl
    float       projHigh
    int         projHighOffset
    float       projLow
    int         projLowOffset

var AiFcast curAiFcast = na
var array<AiFcast> aiFootprint = array.new<AiFcast>()
const int AI_FOOTPRINT_CAP = 5

f_aiComputeShape(int nearestIdx) =>
    patternHighL = aiH.row(nearestIdx)
    patternLowL = aiL.row(nearestIdx)
    arrHighs = array.new<float>()
    arrLows = array.new<float>()
    for i = 1 to patternHighL.size() - 1
        array.push(arrHighs, (patternHighL.get(i) / patternHighL.get(0)) * high)
        array.push(arrLows, (patternLowL.get(i) / patternLowL.get(0)) * low)
    [arrHighs, arrLows]

f_aiArgExtreme(array<float> arr, bool findMax) =>
    bestIdx = 0
    bestVal = array.get(arr, 0)
    for i = 1 to array.size(arr) - 1
        v = array.get(arr, i)
        isBetter = findMax ? v > bestVal : v < bestVal
        if isBetter
            bestVal := v
            bestIdx := i
    [bestIdx, bestVal]

f_aiDrawForecast(array<float> arrHighs, array<float> arrLows) =>
    barCount = array.size(arrHighs)
    snap = AiFcast.new()
    snap.boxes := array.new<box>()
    aiPrevMidL = (high + low) / 2
    aiBarMsL = tfSecondsForZones * 1000
    aiGapFracL = 0.05
    for i = 0 to barCount - 1
        bH = array.get(arrHighs, i)
        bL = array.get(arrLows, i)
        bMid = (bH + bL) / 2
        barDelta = bMid - aiPrevMidL
        barCol = barDelta > atr * aiSwingThreshATR ? aiColorUp : barDelta < -atr * aiSwingThreshATR ? aiColorDown : aiColorNeutral
        leftT = int(math.round(time + (i + aiGapFracL) * aiBarMsL))
        rightT = int(math.round(time + (i + 1 - aiGapFracL) * aiBarMsL))
        bx = box.new(leftT, bH, rightT, bL, xloc = xloc.bar_time, border_color = color.new(f_tint(barCol, 0.15), T_AI_LINE), border_width = 3, border_style = line.style_dashed, bgcolor = f_tintA(barCol, 0.55, 85))
        array.push(snap.boxes, bx)
        aiPrevMidL := bMid
    firstHighL = array.get(arrHighs, 0)
    firstLowL = array.get(arrLows, 0)
    lastHighL = array.get(arrHighs, barCount - 1)
    lastLowL = array.get(arrLows, barCount - 1)
    highestPointL = array.max(arrHighs)
    lowestPointL = array.min(arrLows)
    overallDeltaL = ((lastHighL + lastLowL) / 2) - ((firstHighL + firstLowL) / 2)
    dirNow = overallDeltaL > atr * aiSwingThreshATR ? 1 : overallDeltaL < -atr * aiSwingThreshATR ? -1 : 0
    rawArrowCol = dirNow == 1 ? aiColorUp : dirNow == -1 ? aiColorDown : aiColorNeutral
    arrowGradCol = color.new(f_tint(rawArrowCol, 0.15), T_AI_ARROW)
    snap.arrowLn := dirNow == -1 ? line.new(bar_index, highestPointL, bar_index + barCount - 1, lowestPointL, color = arrowGradCol, style = line.style_arrow_right, width = 1) : dirNow == 1 ? line.new(bar_index, firstLowL, bar_index + barCount - 1, lastHighL, color = arrowGradCol, style = line.style_arrow_right, width = 1) : line.new(bar_index, (firstHighL + firstLowL) / 2, bar_index + barCount - 1, (lastHighL + lastLowL) / 2, color = arrowGradCol, style = line.style_arrow_right, width = 1)
    snap.lnTop := line.new(bar_index, highestPointL, bar_index + barCount - 1, highestPointL, color = color.new(aiColorUp, T50), style = line.style_solid, extend = extend.right, width = 1)
    snap.lnMid := line.new(bar_index, (highestPointL + lowestPointL) / 2, bar_index + barCount - 1, (highestPointL + lowestPointL) / 2, color = color.new(chart.fg_color, T50), style = line.style_solid, extend = extend.right, width = 1)
    snap.lnBot := line.new(bar_index, lowestPointL, bar_index + barCount - 1, lowestPointL, color = color.new(aiColorDown, T50), style = line.style_solid, extend = extend.right, width = 1)
    [hIdx, hVal] = f_aiArgExtreme(arrHighs, true)
    [lIdx, lVal] = f_aiArgExtreme(arrLows, false)
    snap.bornBar := bar_index
    snap.targetBar := bar_index + barCount
    snap.startMid := (high + low) / 2
    snap.dir := dirNow
    snap.resolved := false
    snap.projHigh := hVal
    snap.projHighOffset := hIdx + 1
    snap.projLow := lVal
    snap.projLowOffset := lIdx + 1
    snap

f_aiMarkFootprint(AiFcast snap) =>
    if array.size(snap.boxes) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(snap.boxes) - 1
            box.set_border_color(array.get(snap.boxes, i), color.new(color.gray, 40))
            box.set_bgcolor(array.get(snap.boxes, i), color.new(color.gray, 85))
    line.set_color(snap.arrowLn, color.new(color.gray, 40))
    line.set_color(snap.lnTop, color.new(color.gray, 40))
    line.set_color(snap.lnMid, color.new(color.gray, 40))
    line.set_color(snap.lnBot, color.new(color.gray, 40))

f_aiConfirm(AiFcast snap) =>
    offset = bar_index - snap.targetBar
    actualMid = (high[offset] + low[offset]) / 2
    actualDelta = actualMid - snap.startMid
    actualDir = actualDelta > atr * aiSwingThreshATR ? 1 : actualDelta < -atr * aiSwingThreshATR ? -1 : 0
    matched = actualDir == snap.dir
    lblCol = matched ? color.green : color.red
    lblTxt = matched ? "✓ TRUE" : "✕ FALSE"
    snap.resultLbl := label.new(snap.targetBar, actualMid, lblTxt, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.new(lblCol, 70), size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)

f_aiDeleteSnap(AiFcast snap) =>
    if array.size(snap.boxes) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(snap.boxes) - 1
            box.delete(array.get(snap.boxes, i))
    line.delete(snap.arrowLn)
    line.delete(snap.lnTop)
    line.delete(snap.lnMid)
    line.delete(snap.lnBot)
    label.delete(snap.resultLbl)

if showAIForecast and barstate.isconfirmed and bar_index > aiNTotal
    aiYVal = math.log(aiYSrc[0]) - math.log(aiYSrc[aiHorizon])
    x_body = f_aiUpdateDictionary(aiD, aiDictInput.body)
    x_range = f_aiUpdateDictionary(aiD2, aiDictInput.crange)
    x_wick_low = f_aiUpdateDictionary(aiD3, aiDictInput.wick_low)
    x_wick_high = f_aiUpdateDictionary(aiD4, aiDictInput.wick_high)
    f_aiUpdateHistorical(aiH, aiHistInput.hhigh)
    f_aiUpdateHistorical(aiL, aiHistInput.hlow)
    if aiY.size() >= aiDictSize
        aiY.shift()
    aiY.push(aiYVal)
    aiDist = f_aiRunQuery(x_body, x_range, x_wick_low, x_wick_high, aiD, aiD2, aiD3, aiD4)
    [aiAvg, aiConfidence, aiNearest] = f_aiKNN(aiDist, aiNeighbors, aiKnnWeighting.distance)
    aiYHat := aiAvg
    aiConf := aiConfidence
    aiNearestNeighbor := aiNearest
    aiYHatLine := aiYSrc + (aiYSrc * (math.exp(aiAvg) - 1))

    if not na(curAiFcast)
        if not curAiFcast.resolved
            if bar_index >= curAiFcast.targetBar
                f_aiConfirm(curAiFcast)
                f_aiMarkFootprint(curAiFcast)
                curAiFcast.resolved := true
                array.push(aiFootprint, curAiFcast)
                while array.size(aiFootprint) > AI_FOOTPRINT_CAP
                    oldestFcast = array.shift(aiFootprint)
                    f_aiDeleteSnap(oldestFcast)

    needNewFcast = na(curAiFcast)
    if not na(curAiFcast)
        needNewFcast := curAiFcast.resolved
    if needNewFcast and aiH.rows() > 0
        nearestIdxNew = int(math.max(0, math.min(math.min(aiNearestNeighbor + 5, aiDictSize - 5), aiH.rows() - 1)))
        [arrHighsNew, arrLowsNew] = f_aiComputeShape(nearestIdxNew)
        if array.size(arrHighsNew) > 0
            curAiFcast := f_aiDrawForecast(arrHighsNew, arrLowsNew)

if not na(aiYHat)
    aiYHatSmooth := aiPredFilterLen > 0 ? ta.ema(aiYHat, aiPredFilterLen) : aiYHat

aiRefHigh = aiYHatLine + aiAtrMult * aiAtrBands
aiRefLow  = aiYHatLine - aiAtrMult * aiAtrBands
aiHH = ta.highest(aiRefHigh, aiRegimeLookback)
aiLL = ta.lowest(aiRefLow, aiRegimeLookback)
if aiHH == aiRefHigh
    aiYHatTrend := true
if aiLL == aiRefLow
    aiYHatTrend := false
aiNBars += 1
if ta.change(aiYHatTrend)
    aiNBars := 1
aiHMax := ta.highest(aiRefHigh, aiNBars)
aiLMin := ta.lowest(aiRefLow, aiNBars)
aiMMid := math.avg(aiHMax, aiLMin)
if aiNBars == 1
    aiHMax := na
    aiLMin := na
    aiMMid := na

// ============================================================================
// SHARED PIVOT / ZIGZAG STORE
// Feeds swing structure, clustered S/R, AND the pattern engine off the SAME
// alternating pivot sequence — no duplicated pivot detection between halves.
// ============================================================================
var array<int>   zzB = array.new<int>()
var array<float> zzP = array.new<float>()
var array<int>   zzD = array.new<int>()
var array<float> zzT = array.new<float>()

ph = ta.pivothigh(pivLen, pivLen)
pl = ta.pivotlow(pivLen, pivLen)

f_pivotTrend(int back) =>
    refC = close[back + trendLookback]
    pivC = close[back]
    refC != 0 ? (pivC - refC) / refC : 0.0

f_zzPush(int b, float pr, int d, float trendPct) =>
    n = array.size(zzD)
    appended = false
    if n == 0
        array.push(zzB, b)
        array.push(zzP, pr)
        array.push(zzD, d)
        array.push(zzT, trendPct)
        appended := true
    else
        li = n - 1
        if array.get(zzD, li) == d
            lp = array.get(zzP, li)
            if (d == 1 and pr > lp) or (d == -1 and pr < lp)
                array.set(zzP, li, pr)
                array.set(zzB, li, b)
                array.set(zzT, li, trendPct)
        else
            array.push(zzB, b)
            array.push(zzP, pr)
            array.push(zzD, d)
            array.push(zzT, trendPct)
            appended := true
    while array.size(zzD) > maxPivots
        array.shift(zzB)
        array.shift(zzP)
        array.shift(zzD)
        array.shift(zzT)
    appended

f_lastTwo(int dir) =>
    float p1 = na
    float p2 = na
    found = 0
    i = array.size(zzD) - 1
    while i >= 0 and found < 2
        if array.get(zzD, i) == dir
            if found == 0
                p2 := array.get(zzP, i)
            else
                p1 := array.get(zzP, i)
            found += 1
        i -= 1
    [p1, p2, found]

// ============================================================================
// CHART PATTERN ENGINE — Double Top/Bottom, Head & Shoulders / Inverse H&S.
// Forming -> confirmed -> resolved lifecycle, ATR-adaptive tolerance, prior-
// trend gate, minimum-depth filter, and a volume-confirmation tag. State
// mutates on closed bars only (barstate.isconfirmed) so nothing repaints.
// ============================================================================
tol = atr * patTolATR
buf = atr * patBufATR

type Pat
    int    kind
    int    dir
    float  neck
    float  neckSlope
    int    neckX
    float  apex
    int    apexBar
    float  target
    float  invalid
    float  ext
    int    confBar
    int    bornBar
    int    coreS
    int    trailB
    bool   confirmed
    int    result
    string volNote
    array<int>   px
    array<float> py
    array<line>  segs
    line   neckLn
    line   tgtLn
    label  tag
    label  resTag

var array<Pat> pats    = array.new<Pat>()
var array<int> patHits = array.new<int>(4, 0)
var array<int> patRes  = array.new<int>(4, 0)

f_name(int k) => k == 1 ? "Double Top" : k == 2 ? "Double Bottom" : k == 3 ? "Head & Shoulders" : "Inverse Head & Shoulders"
f_enabled(int k) => k == 1 ? showDT : k == 2 ? showDB : k == 3 ? showHS : showIHS
f_neckAt(Pat p, int b) => p.neck + p.neckSlope * (b - p.neckX)
f_volNote(float ratio) => ratio >= 1.4 ? "vol kuat ✓" : ratio <= 0.6 ? "vol tipis ⚠" : "vol sedang"

f_newPat(int kind, int dir, float neck, float neckSlope, int neckX, float apex, int apexBar, float invalid, float ext) =>
    p = Pat.new()
    p.kind := kind
    p.dir := dir
    p.neck := neck
    p.neckSlope := neckSlope
    p.neckX := neckX
    p.apex := apex
    p.apexBar := apexBar
    p.invalid := invalid
    p.ext := ext
    p.bornBar := bar_index
    p.confirmed := false
    p.result := 0
    p.volNote := ""
    p.px := array.new<int>()
    p.py := array.new<float>()
    p.segs := array.new<line>()
    array.push(pats, p)
    p

f_addPt(Pat p, int b, float v) =>
    array.push(p.px, b)
    array.push(p.py, v)

f_regionTaken(int s, int e) =>
    taken = false
    sp = e - s
    i = 0
    while i < array.size(pats) and not taken
        p = array.get(pats, i)
        m = array.size(p.px)
        if m >= 2
            ps = array.get(p.px, 0)
            pe = array.get(p.px, m - 1)
            ov = math.min(e, pe) - math.max(s, ps)
            if ov > 0.15 * math.min(sp, pe - ps)
                taken := true
        i += 1
    taken

f_crossBar(int fromBar, int toBar, float level, bool bear, int maxBack, float slp) =>
    cb = -1
    done = false
    lim = math.max(1, math.min(maxBack, fromBar - toBar))
    for k = 1 to lim
        o = bar_index - fromBar + k
        lv = level - slp * k
        if not done and o >= 0 and o <= 4990 and ((bear and low[o] <= lv) or ((not bear) and high[o] >= lv))
            cb := fromBar - k
            done := true
    cb

f_matchHigh() =>
    n = array.size(zzD)
    matched5 = false
    if n >= 5 and showHS
        ls = array.get(zzP, n - 5)
        t1 = array.get(zzP, n - 4)
        hd = array.get(zzP, n - 3)
        t2 = array.get(zzP, n - 2)
        rs = array.get(zzP, n - 1)
        lsBar = array.get(zzB, n - 5)
        lsTrend = array.get(zzT, n - 5)
        legW = math.max(3, int((array.get(zzB, n - 1) - lsBar) / 4))
        b1 = array.get(zzB, n - 4)
        b2 = array.get(zzB, n - 2)
        slope = (t2 - t1) / (b2 - b1)
        crossB = f_crossBar(lsBar, array.get(zzB, math.max(0, n - 6)), t1 + slope * (lsBar - b1), true, 2 * legW, slope)
        startB = crossB >= 0 ? crossB : (n >= 6 ? array.get(zzB, n - 6) : lsBar)
        trailBar = array.get(zzB, n - 1) + legW
        trendOk = not useTrendGate or lsTrend >= trendGatePct
        if hd > ls + tol and hd > rs + tol and math.abs(ls - rs) <= 2 * tol and math.abs(t1 - t2) <= 0.35 * (hd - math.min(t1, t2)) and trendOk and not f_regionTaken(startB, trailBar)
            p = f_newPat(3, -1, t1, slope, b1, hd, array.get(zzB, n - 3), rs, hd)
            p.coreS := startB
            p.trailB := trailBar
            if crossB >= 0
                f_addPt(p, crossB, t1 + slope * (crossB - b1))
            else if n >= 6
                f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 6), array.get(zzP, n - 6))
            f_addPt(p, lsBar, ls)
            f_addPt(p, b1, t1)
            f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 3), hd)
            f_addPt(p, b2, t2)
            f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 1), rs)
            matched5 := true
    if n >= 3 and showDT and not matched5
        h1 = array.get(zzP, n - 3)
        l1 = array.get(zzP, n - 2)
        h2 = array.get(zzP, n - 1)
        h1Bar = array.get(zzB, n - 3)
        h1Trend = array.get(zzT, n - 3)
        legW = math.max(3, int((array.get(zzB, n - 1) - h1Bar) / 2))
        crossB = f_crossBar(h1Bar, array.get(zzB, math.max(0, n - 4)), l1, true, 2 * legW, 0.0)
        startB = crossB >= 0 ? crossB : (n >= 4 ? array.get(zzB, n - 4) : h1Bar)
        trailBar = array.get(zzB, n - 1) + legW
        trendOk = not useTrendGate or h1Trend >= trendGatePct
        if math.abs(h1 - h2) <= tol and (dblMode == "Any" or h2 <= h1 + tol * 0.25) and math.min(h1, h2) - l1 > 1.5 * tol and trendOk and not f_regionTaken(startB, trailBar)
            ex = math.max(h1, h2)
            p = f_newPat(1, -1, l1, 0.0, array.get(zzB, n - 2), (h1 + h2) / 2, array.get(zzB, n - 1), ex, ex)
            p.coreS := startB
            p.trailB := trailBar
            if crossB >= 0
                f_addPt(p, crossB, l1)
            else if n >= 4
                f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 4), array.get(zzP, n - 4))
            f_addPt(p, h1Bar, h1)
            f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 2), l1)
            f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 1), h2)

f_matchLow() =>
    n = array.size(zzD)
    matched5 = false
    if n >= 5 and showIHS
        ls = array.get(zzP, n - 5)
        t1 = array.get(zzP, n - 4)
        hd = array.get(zzP, n - 3)
        t2 = array.get(zzP, n - 2)
        rs = array.get(zzP, n - 1)
        lsBar = array.get(zzB, n - 5)
        lsTrend = array.get(zzT, n - 5)
        legW = math.max(3, int((array.get(zzB, n - 1) - lsBar) / 4))
        b1 = array.get(zzB, n - 4)
        b2 = array.get(zzB, n - 2)
        slope = (t2 - t1) / (b2 - b1)
        crossB = f_crossBar(lsBar, array.get(zzB, math.max(0, n - 6)), t1 + slope * (lsBar - b1), false, 2 * legW, slope)
        startB = crossB >= 0 ? crossB : (n >= 6 ? array.get(zzB, n - 6) : lsBar)
        trailBar = array.get(zzB, n - 1) + legW
        trendOk = not useTrendGate or lsTrend <= -trendGatePct
        if hd < ls - tol and hd < rs - tol and math.abs(ls - rs) <= 2 * tol and math.abs(t1 - t2) <= 0.35 * (math.max(t1, t2) - hd) and trendOk and not f_regionTaken(startB, trailBar)
            p = f_newPat(4, 1, t1, slope, b1, hd, array.get(zzB, n - 3), rs, hd)
            p.coreS := startB
            p.trailB := trailBar
            if crossB >= 0
                f_addPt(p, crossB, t1 + slope * (crossB - b1))
            else if n >= 6
                f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 6), array.get(zzP, n - 6))
            f_addPt(p, lsBar, ls)
            f_addPt(p, b1, t1)
            f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 3), hd)
            f_addPt(p, b2, t2)
            f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 1), rs)
            matched5 := true
    if n >= 3 and showDB and not matched5
        l1 = array.get(zzP, n - 3)
        h1 = array.get(zzP, n - 2)
        l2 = array.get(zzP, n - 1)
        l1Bar = array.get(zzB, n - 3)
        l1Trend = array.get(zzT, n - 3)
        legW = math.max(3, int((array.get(zzB, n - 1) - l1Bar) / 2))
        crossB = f_crossBar(l1Bar, array.get(zzB, math.max(0, n - 4)), h1, false, 2 * legW, 0.0)
        startB = crossB >= 0 ? crossB : (n >= 4 ? array.get(zzB, n - 4) : l1Bar)
        trailBar = array.get(zzB, n - 1) + legW
        trendOk = not useTrendGate or l1Trend <= -trendGatePct
        if math.abs(l1 - l2) <= tol and (dblMode == "Any" or l2 >= l1 - tol * 0.25) and h1 - math.max(l1, l2) > 1.5 * tol and trendOk and not f_regionTaken(startB, trailBar)
            ex = math.min(l1, l2)
            p = f_newPat(2, 1, h1, 0.0, array.get(zzB, n - 2), (l1 + l2) / 2, array.get(zzB, n - 1), ex, ex)
            p.coreS := startB
            p.trailB := trailBar
            if crossB >= 0
                f_addPt(p, crossB, h1)
            else if n >= 4
                f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 4), array.get(zzP, n - 4))
            f_addPt(p, l1Bar, l1)
            f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 2), h1)
            f_addPt(p, array.get(zzB, n - 1), l2)

f_crossFwd(Pat p) =>
    mm = array.size(p.px)
    lastB = array.get(p.px, mm - 1)
    tb = p.confBar
    done = false
    lim = math.max(1, p.confBar - lastB)
    for k = 1 to lim
        b = lastB + k
        o = bar_index - b
        lv = f_neckAt(p, b)
        if not done and o >= 0 and ((p.dir == -1 and low[o] <= lv) or (p.dir == 1 and high[o] >= lv))
            tb := b
            done := true
    tb

f_draw(Pat p) =>
    col = p.dir == -1 ? bearCol : bullCol
    tb = f_crossFwd(p)
    f_addPt(p, tb, f_neckAt(p, tb))
    p.trailB := math.max(p.trailB, tb)
    m = array.size(p.px)
    pmin = array.get(p.py, 0)
    pmax = pmin
    for k = 0 to m - 1
        v = array.get(p.py, k)
        pmin := math.min(pmin, v)
        pmax := math.max(pmax, v)
    if m >= 2
        for k = 0 to m - 2
            ln = line.new(array.get(p.px, k), array.get(p.py, k), array.get(p.px, k + 1), array.get(p.py, k + 1), color = color.new(col, T50), width = 3)
            array.push(p.segs, ln)
    p.neckLn := line.new(p.coreS, f_neckAt(p, p.coreS), p.trailB, f_neckAt(p, p.trailB), color = color.new(col, T50), style = line.style_dashed, width = 2)
    p.tgtLn := line.new(p.confBar, p.target, p.confBar + TGT_LINE_BARS, p.target, color = f_tint(col, 0.4), style = line.style_dotted, width = 1)
    tagY = p.dir == -1 ? pmax : pmin
    tagText = f_name(p.kind) + " · " + p.volNote
    p.tag := label.new(p.apexBar, tagY, tagText, style = p.dir == -1 ? label.style_label_down : label.style_label_up, color = color.new(col, T50), textcolor = f_textOn(col), size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)

f_delete(Pat p) =>
    if array.size(p.segs) > 0
        for k = 0 to array.size(p.segs) - 1
            line.delete(array.get(p.segs, k))
    line.delete(p.neckLn)
    line.delete(p.tgtLn)
    label.delete(p.tag)
    label.delete(p.resTag)

f_activePattern() =>
    Pat best = na
    if array.size(pats) > 0
        i = 0
        while i < array.size(pats)
            p = array.get(pats, i)
            if p.confirmed and p.result == 0
                if na(best) or p.confBar > best.confBar
                    best := p
            i += 1
    best

f_mostRecentForming() =>
    Pat best = na
    if array.size(pats) > 0
        i = 0
        while i < array.size(pats)
            p = array.get(pats, i)
            if not p.confirmed
                if na(best) or p.bornBar > best.bornBar
                    best := p
            i += 1
    best

f_hitRateStr() =>
    txt = ""
    for k = 1 to 4
        r = array.get(patRes, k - 1)
        if f_enabled(k) and r >= minStat
            h = array.get(patHits, k - 1)
            pct = math.round(100.0 * h / r)
            txt := txt + f_name(k) + " " + str.tostring(h) + "/" + str.tostring(r) + "(" + str.tostring(pct) + "%)  "
    txt == "" ? "belum ada data" : txt

// ============================================================================
// ENGINE — pivot registration, pattern matching, confirm/track/resolve.
// State mutates on closed bars only so alerts and pattern shapes never repaint.
// ============================================================================
bearConf = false
bullConf = false
tgtHit   = false
patFail  = false
newHighPivotFlag = false
newLowPivotFlag  = false
var int lastHighPivotBar = na
var int lastLowPivotBar  = na

if barstate.isconfirmed
    if not na(ph)
        phBar = bar_index - pivLen
        if f_zzPush(phBar, ph, 1, f_pivotTrend(pivLen))
            f_matchHigh()
            newHighPivotFlag := true
            lastHighPivotBar := phBar
    if not na(pl)
        plBar = bar_index - pivLen
        if f_zzPush(plBar, pl, -1, f_pivotTrend(pivLen))
            f_matchLow()
            newLowPivotFlag := true
            lastLowPivotBar := plBar

    i = 0
    while i < array.size(pats)
        p = array.get(pats, i)
        gone = false
        if not p.confirmed
            neckNow = f_neckAt(p, bar_index)
            vtol = tol + atr * voidTolATR
            if p.dir == -1
                if high > p.ext + vtol
                    gone := true
                else if (confMode == "Wick" ? low : close) < neckNow - buf
                    p.confirmed := true
            else
                if low < p.ext - vtol
                    gone := true
                else if (confMode == "Wick" ? high : close) > neckNow + buf
                    p.confirmed := true
            if not gone and not p.confirmed and bar_index - p.bornBar > maxWaitBars
                gone := true
            if p.confirmed
                p.confBar := bar_index
                p.volNote := f_volNote(rvol)
                neckC = f_neckAt(p, bar_index)
                height = p.dir == -1 ? p.apex - f_neckAt(p, p.apexBar) : f_neckAt(p, p.apexBar) - p.apex
                p.target := p.dir == -1 ? neckC - height : neckC + height
                f_draw(p)
                if p.dir == -1
                    bearConf := true
                else
                    bullConf := true
        else if p.result == 0
            if p.dir == -1
                if low <= p.target
                    p.result := 1
                else if close >= p.invalid
                    p.result := 2
            else
                if high >= p.target
                    p.result := 1
                else if close <= p.invalid
                    p.result := 2
            if p.result == 0 and bar_index - p.confBar > trackBars
                p.result := 3
            if p.result == 1 or p.result == 2 or p.result == 3
                ki = p.kind - 1
                array.set(patRes, ki, array.get(patRes, ki) + 1)
                if p.result == 1
                    array.set(patHits, ki, array.get(patHits, ki) + 1)
                    outCol = p.dir == -1 ? bearCol : bullCol
                    if not na(p.tgtLn)
                        line.set_x2(p.tgtLn, bar_index)
                    if showPatternOutcomes
                        p.resTag := label.new(bar_index, p.target, "✓ target", style = p.dir == -1 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color = color.new(outCol, T50), textcolor = f_textOn(outCol), size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)
                    tgtHit := true
                else if p.result == 2
                    if showPatternOutcomes
                        p.resTag := label.new(bar_index, p.invalid, "✕ invalid", style = p.dir == -1 ? label.style_label_down : label.style_label_up, color = color.new(color.gray, T50), textcolor = color.white, size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)
                    patFail := true
        if gone
            f_delete(p)
            array.remove(pats, i)
        else
            i += 1

    cnt = 0
    if array.size(pats) > 0
        for k = 0 to array.size(pats) - 1
            if array.get(pats, k).confirmed
                cnt += 1
    while cnt > maxKeepPatterns
        idx = -1
        j = 0
        while j < array.size(pats) and idx < 0
            if array.get(pats, j).confirmed
                idx := j
            j += 1
        if idx >= 0
            f_delete(array.get(pats, idx))
            array.remove(pats, idx)
        cnt -= 1

activePattern = f_activePattern()
patternBias2      = na(activePattern) ? 0 : activePattern.dir
patternConfirmed2 = not na(activePattern)
patternTarget2    = not na(activePattern) ? activePattern.target : na
patternName2      = not na(activePattern) ? f_name(activePattern.kind) : "NONE"

f_hasForming(int dir) =>
    found = false
    if array.size(pats) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(pats) - 1
            p = array.get(pats, i)
            if not p.confirmed and p.dir == dir
                found := true
    found
bullForming = f_hasForming(1)
bearForming = f_hasForming(-1)

// ── Swing structure — HH/HL vs LH/LL, off the same shared pivots ──
[prevPH, lastPH, hFound] = f_lastTwo(1)
[prevPL, lastPL, lFound] = f_lastTwo(-1)
hh = hFound == 2 and lastPH > prevPH
hl = lFound == 2 and lastPL > prevPL
lh = hFound == 2 and lastPH < prevPH
ll = lFound == 2 and lastPL < prevPL
structureBias = hh and hl ? 1 : lh and ll ? -1 : 0
structureText = structureBias == 1 ? "HH + HL" : structureBias == -1 ? "LH + LL" : "MIXED / RANGE"

// ── Clustered Support / Resistance — swing-pivot based, with the fallback
// window now scaled to ~1-2 weeks of trading days (srLenAdaptive) instead of
// a fixed bar count, and MA20/MA50 blended in as dynamic S/R when the trend
// backs it, per "gunakan MA dan SW ... area lebih pendek" requirement. ──
rawSupport = not na(lastPL) and lastPL < close ? lastPL : ta.lowest(low, srLenAdaptive)[1]
rawResistance = not na(lastPH) and lastPH > close ? lastPH : ta.highest(high, srLenAdaptive)[1]
supportClustered = lFound == 2 and math.abs(lastPL - prevPL) <= atr * effClusterATR ? (lastPL + prevPL) / 2.0 : rawSupport
resistanceClustered = hFound == 2 and math.abs(lastPH - prevPH) <= atr * effClusterATR ? (lastPH + prevPH) / 2.0 : rawResistance
// Dynamic MA support/resistance: MA20 acting as support in an uptrend or
// resistance in a downtrend, taken only when it sits BETWEEN the swing level
// and price (i.e. only when it tightens the range, never widens it).
maSupportCandidate = trendBias >= 1 and ma20 < close ? ma20 : na
maResistCandidate  = trendBias <= -1 and ma20 > close ? ma20 : na
support1 = not na(maSupportCandidate) and maSupportCandidate > supportClustered ? maSupportCandidate : supportClustered
resist1  = not na(maResistCandidate) and maResistCandidate < resistanceClustered ? maResistCandidate : resistanceClustered
support2 = ta.lowest(low, int(srLenAdaptive * srLenAdaptive2Mult))[1]
resist2  = ta.highest(high, int(srLenAdaptive * srLenAdaptive2Mult))[1]
supportZoneLow  = support1 - atr * effClusterATR * 0.5
supportZoneHigh = support1 + atr * effClusterATR * 0.5
resistZoneLow   = resist1 - atr * effClusterATR * 0.5
resistZoneHigh  = resist1 + atr * effClusterATR * 0.5
statusAnchorHigh = ta.highest(high, 20)

// ============================================================================
// BREAKOUT / RETEST / CANDLESTICK PATTERN (single-bar taxonomy)
// ============================================================================
breakBuffer = atr * srBreakoutBuf
bullBreakout = not na(resistZoneHigh) and close > resistZoneHigh + breakBuffer and close[1] <= resistZoneHigh[1] + breakBuffer
bearBreakdown = not na(supportZoneLow) and close < supportZoneLow - breakBuffer and close[1] >= supportZoneLow[1] - breakBuffer
breakoutVolumeOK = rvol >= breakoutRVOL and (bullBreakout ? closeLocation >= 0.65 : bearBreakdown ? closeLocation <= 0.35 : true)
falseBullBreak = bullBreakout and (rvol < 1.0 or closeLocation < 0.50)
falseBearBreak = bearBreakdown and (rvol < 1.0 or closeLocation > 0.50)

barsSinceBullBreak = ta.barssince(bullBreakout and breakoutVolumeOK)
barsSinceBearBreak = ta.barssince(bearBreakdown and breakoutVolumeOK)
bullRetest = barsSinceBullBreak >= 1 and barsSinceBullBreak <= retestBars and low <= resistZoneHigh + atr * 0.20 and close > resistZoneHigh and close > open
bearRetest = barsSinceBearBreak >= 1 and barsSinceBearBreak <= retestBars and high >= supportZoneLow - atr * 0.20 and close < supportZoneLow and close < open

f_candlePattern() =>
    rng = (high - low) == 0 ? 1e-9 : (high - low)
    bodyV = math.abs(close - open)
    bodyPct = bodyV / rng
    upperWickV = high - math.max(open, close)
    lowerWickV = math.min(open, close) - low
    bullBar = close > open
    string nameV = na
    int biasV = 0
    prevBull = close[1] > open[1]
    engulfsUp = not prevBull and bullBar and open <= close[1] and close >= open[1]
    engulfsDown = prevBull and not bullBar and open >= close[1] and close <= open[1]
    midPrev = (open[1] + close[1]) / 2
    if engulfsUp
        nameV := "Bullish Engulfing"
        biasV := 1
    else if engulfsDown
        nameV := "Bearish Engulfing"
        biasV := -1
    else if not prevBull and bullBar and open < low[1] and close > midPrev and close < open[1]
        nameV := "Piercing Line"
        biasV := 1
    else if prevBull and not bullBar and open > high[1] and close < midPrev and close > open[1]
        nameV := "Dark Cloud Cover"
        biasV := -1
    else if bodyPct < 0.08
        nameV := "Doji"
        biasV := 0
    else if bodyPct > 0.7 and upperWickV / rng < 0.12 and lowerWickV / rng < 0.12
        nameV := bullBar ? "Bullish Marubozu" : "Bearish Marubozu"
        biasV := bullBar ? 1 : -1
    else if lowerWickV > 2 * bodyV and upperWickV < bodyV and bodyPct < 0.4
        nameV := "Hammer/Hanging Man"
        biasV := bullBar ? 1 : 0
    else if upperWickV > 2 * bodyV and lowerWickV < bodyV and bodyPct < 0.4
        nameV := "Shooting Star/Inv.Hammer"
        biasV := bullBar ? 0 : -1
    else if bodyPct >= 0.08 and bodyPct < 0.35
        nameV := "Spinning Top"
        biasV := 0
    else
        nameV := bullBar ? "Bullish" : "Bearish"
        biasV := bullBar ? 1 : -1
    [nameV, biasV]

[candleNameCur, candleBiasCur] = f_candlePattern()
bullCandleConfirm = candleBiasCur == 1
bearCandleConfirm = candleBiasCur == -1
candleText = candleNameCur

// ============================================================================
// MARKET, MTF & RELATIVE STRENGTH — native TradingView data, no external feed
// ============================================================================
currentSymbol = syminfo.tickerid
autoHTF = timeframe.isintraday ? "D" : timeframe.isdaily ? "W" : "M"
mtfTF = mtfMode == "Auto" ? autoHTF : mtfManual
[mClose, m20, m50] = request.security(marketSymbol, timeframe.period, [close, ta.ema(close, 20), ta.ema(close, 50)], ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
marketBias = not useMarket or na(mClose) ? 0 : mClose > m20 and m20 > m50 ? 1 : mClose < m20 and m20 < m50 ? -1 : 0
[htfClose, htf20, htf50] = request.security(currentSymbol, mtfTF, [close, ta.ema(close, 20), ta.ema(close, 50)], ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
mtfBias = htfClose > htf20 and htf20 > htf50 ? 1 : htfClose < htf20 and htf20 < htf50 ? -1 : 0
benchClose = request.security(sectorSymbol, timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
rsRatio = useSector and not na(benchClose) and benchClose != 0 ? close / benchClose : na
rsMA = ta.ema(rsRatio, 20)
rsBias = not useSector or na(rsRatio) ? 0 : rsRatio > rsMA and rsMA > rsMA[5] ? 1 : rsRatio < rsMA and rsMA < rsMA[5] ? -1 : 0

// ============================================================================
// INDEPENDENT BULL / BEAR SCORE — not-bullish is NOT automatically bearish;
// both can be low at once in a genuine range.
// ============================================================================
float bullScore = 5.0
float bearScore = 5.0
bullScore += trendBias == 2 ? 20 : trendBias == 1 ? 12 : 0
bearScore += trendBias == -2 ? 20 : trendBias == -1 ? 12 : 0
bullScore += structureBias == 1 ? 15 : structureBias == 0 and hl ? 7 : 0
bearScore += structureBias == -1 ? 15 : structureBias == 0 and lh ? 7 : 0
bullScore += mtfBias == 1 ? 10 : 0
bearScore += mtfBias == -1 ? 10 : 0
bullScore += marketBias == 1 ? 8 : marketBias == 0 ? 3 : 0
bearScore += marketBias == -1 ? 8 : marketBias == 0 ? 3 : 0
bullScore += rsBias == 1 ? 6 : not useSector ? 3 : 0
bearScore += rsBias == -1 ? 6 : not useSector ? 3 : 0
bullScore += phaseBias == 1 ? (volHot and veloHot ? 8 : 5) : 0
bearScore += phaseBias == -1 ? (volHot and veloHot ? 8 : 5) : 0
bullScore += showAIForecast and not na(aiYHat) and aiYHatTrend ? 4 : 0
bearScore += showAIForecast and not na(aiYHat) and not aiYHatTrend ? 4 : 0
bullScore += patternBias2 == 1 ? 12 : bullForming ? 4 : 0
bearScore += patternBias2 == -1 ? 12 : bearForming ? 4 : 0
bullScore += bullBreakout and breakoutVolumeOK ? 12 : bullRetest ? 10 : 0
bearScore += bearBreakdown and breakoutVolumeOK ? 12 : bearRetest ? 10 : 0
bullScore += bullCandleConfirm ? 5 : 0
bearScore += bearCandleConfirm ? 5 : 0
bullScore += rsi >= 50 and rsi <= 72 ? 5 : rsi > 72 and rsi < 80 ? 2 : 0
bearScore += rsi <= 50 and rsi >= 28 ? 5 : rsi < 28 and rsi > 20 ? 2 : 0
bullScore += adx >= adxTrend and plusDI > minusDI ? (adx >= adxStrong ? 7 : 5) : adx < adxTrend and close > ma20 ? 2 : 0
bearScore += adx >= adxTrend and minusDI > plusDI ? (adx >= adxStrong ? 7 : 5) : adx < adxTrend and close < ma20 ? 2 : 0
bullScore += rvol >= breakoutRVOL ? 3 : rvol >= minRVOL ? 1 : 0
bearScore += rvol >= breakoutRVOL ? 3 : rvol >= minRVOL ? 1 : 0
bullScore += liquidityOK ? 2 : 0
bearScore += liquidityOK ? 2 : 0
bullScore -= falseBullBreak ? 18 : rsi >= 82 ? 6 : 0
bearScore -= falseBearBreak ? 18 : rsi <= 18 ? 6 : 0
bullScore := f_clamp(bullScore, 0, 100)
bearScore := f_clamp(bearScore, 0, 100)
scoreEdge = bullScore - bearScore
neutralScore = f_clamp(100 - math.max(bullScore, bearScore), 0, 100)

// ============================================================================
// TRADING PLAN — entry, stop, market-aware TP1/TP2 (uses the pattern engine's
// OWN validated target, not a second independent pattern read)
// ============================================================================
extendedLong = close - ma20 > atr * maxExtension
extendedShort = ma20 - close > atr * maxExtension
nearSupport = not na(support1) and low <= supportZoneHigh + atr * 0.25 and close >= supportZoneLow
nearResistance = not na(resist1) and high >= resistZoneLow - atr * 0.25 and close <= resistZoneHigh

longEvidence = (bullBreakout and breakoutVolumeOK) or bullRetest or (patternBias2 == 1 and rvol >= 1.0) or (nearSupport and bullCandleConfirm and structureBias >= 0)
shortEvidence = (bearBreakdown and breakoutVolumeOK) or bearRetest or (patternBias2 == -1 and rvol >= 1.0) or (nearResistance and bearCandleConfirm and structureBias <= 0)

longSetup = bullScore >= setupThreshold and scoreEdge >= minScoreEdge and trendBias >= 0 and mtfBias >= 0 and liquidityOK and rvol >= minRVOL and not extendedLong and not falseBullBreak
shortSetup = bearScore >= setupThreshold and -scoreEdge >= minScoreEdge and trendBias <= 0 and mtfBias <= 0 and liquidityOK and rvol >= minRVOL and not extendedShort and not falseBearBreak
longConfirmed = longSetup and bullScore >= confirmThreshold and longEvidence
shortConfirmed = shortSetup and bearScore >= confirmThreshold and shortEvidence

longEntryMid = bullRetest ? resistZoneHigh + atr * 0.05 : bullBreakout ? resistZoneHigh + breakBuffer * 0.5 : nearSupport ? support1 + atr * 0.20 : close
longEntryLow = longEntryMid - atr * effZoneATR
longEntryHigh= longEntryMid + atr * effZoneATR
longStopBase = not na(supportZoneLow) ? supportZoneLow - atr * effStopATR : longEntryLow - atr * effStopATR
longStop = math.min(longStopBase, longEntryLow - atr * effStopATR)
longRisk = math.max(longEntryMid - longStop, syminfo.mintick)
longRRTarget1 = longEntryMid + longRisk * 2.0
longRRTarget2 = longEntryMid + longRisk * 3.0
longStructT1 = not na(resist1) and resist1 > longEntryHigh + longRisk * minRR ? resist1 : na
longStructT2 = not na(resist2) and resist2 > longEntryHigh ? resist2 : na
longTP1 = not na(longStructT1) ? math.min(longRRTarget1, longStructT1) : longRRTarget1
longTP1 := longTP1 <= longEntryMid ? longRRTarget1 : longTP1
longTP2Candidate = not na(patternTarget2) and patternTarget2 > longTP1 ? patternTarget2 : not na(longStructT2) and longStructT2 > longTP1 ? longStructT2 : longRRTarget2
longTP2 = math.max(longTP1 + longRisk * 0.5, math.min(longRRTarget2, longTP2Candidate))
longRR1 = (longTP1 - longEntryMid) / longRisk
longRR2 = (longTP2 - longEntryMid) / longRisk

shortEntryMid = bearRetest ? supportZoneLow - atr * 0.05 : bearBreakdown ? supportZoneLow - breakBuffer * 0.5 : nearResistance ? resist1 - atr * 0.20 : close
shortEntryLow = shortEntryMid - atr * effZoneATR
shortEntryHigh= shortEntryMid + atr * effZoneATR
shortStopBase = not na(resistZoneHigh) ? resistZoneHigh + atr * effStopATR : shortEntryHigh + atr * effStopATR
shortStop = math.max(shortStopBase, shortEntryHigh + atr * effStopATR)
shortRisk = math.max(shortStop - shortEntryMid, syminfo.mintick)
shortRRTarget1 = shortEntryMid - shortRisk * 2.0
shortRRTarget2 = shortEntryMid - shortRisk * 3.0
shortStructT1 = not na(support1) and support1 < shortEntryLow - shortRisk * minRR ? support1 : na
shortStructT2 = not na(support2) and support2 < shortEntryLow ? support2 : na
shortTP1 = not na(shortStructT1) ? math.max(shortRRTarget1, shortStructT1) : shortRRTarget1
shortTP1 := shortTP1 >= shortEntryMid ? shortRRTarget1 : shortTP1
shortTP2Candidate = not na(patternTarget2) and patternTarget2 < shortTP1 ? patternTarget2 : not na(shortStructT2) and shortStructT2 < shortTP1 ? shortStructT2 : shortRRTarget2
shortTP2 = math.min(shortTP1 - shortRisk * 0.5, math.max(shortRRTarget2, shortTP2Candidate))
shortRR1 = (shortEntryMid - shortTP1) / shortRisk
shortRR2 = (shortEntryMid - shortTP2) / shortRisk

longQualified = longConfirmed and longRR1 >= minRR
shortQualified = enableShort and shortConfirmed and shortRR1 >= minRR

longExit = (close < ma20 and close[1] >= ma20[1] and bearCandleConfirm) or (nearResistance and bearCandleConfirm and bearScore >= setupThreshold) or (bearBreakdown and breakoutVolumeOK)
shortCover = enableShort and ((close > ma20 and close[1] <= ma20[1] and bullCandleConfirm) or (nearSupport and bullCandleConfirm and bullScore >= setupThreshold) or (bullBreakout and breakoutVolumeOK))

activeLong = bullScore > bearScore and scoreEdge >= minScoreEdge
activeShort = enableShort and bearScore > bullScore and -scoreEdge >= minScoreEdge
activeDirection = activeLong ? 1 : activeShort ? -1 : 0
entryLow = activeLong ? longEntryLow : activeShort ? shortEntryLow : na
entryHigh= activeLong ? longEntryHigh : activeShort ? shortEntryHigh : na
stopPrice= activeLong ? longStop : activeShort ? shortStop : na
tp1Price = activeLong ? longTP1 : activeShort ? shortTP1 : na
tp2Price = activeLong ? longTP2 : activeShort ? shortTP2 : na
rr1 = activeLong ? longRR1 : activeShort ? shortRR1 : na
rr2 = activeLong ? longRR2 : activeShort ? shortRR2 : na
activeScore = activeLong ? bullScore : activeShort ? bearScore : math.max(bullScore, bearScore)
confirmedNow = activeLong ? longQualified : activeShort ? shortQualified : false
grade = f_grade(activeScore, nz(rr1, 0), liquidityOK, confirmedNow)
action = longQualified ? "BUY / ENTRY" : shortQualified ? "SELL / SHORT" : longExit ? "SELL / EXIT" : longSetup ? "BUY SETUP — WAIT" : (shortSetup and enableShort) ? "SELL SETUP — WAIT" : extendedLong and bullScore >= setupThreshold ? "DO NOT CHASE" : falseBullBreak ? "BULL TRAP RISK" : falseBearBreak ? "BEAR TRAP RISK" : "WATCH / NO TRADE"

newLong = longQualified and not longQualified[1]
newShort = shortQualified and not shortQualified[1]
newExit = longExit and not longExit[1]
newShortCover = shortCover and not shortCover[1]

// ============================================================================
// ENTRY-BUY / EXIT-SELL CANDLE MARKERS — placed exactly at the swing-wave
// pivot candle itself (the low that just formed a confirmed swing, or the
// high that just formed one), gated by which side the broader Bull/Bear
// score favors at that same bar. This is a genuine "read the swing wave,
// mark the turning candle" recommendation, not just a generic trigger label.
// Limited to the last N days so the chart doesn't fill up with old signals.
// ============================================================================
markerWindowMs = markerLookbackDays * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000
inMarkerWindow = time >= timenow - markerWindowMs

f_stampSignalAt(int atBar, string label_, color baseCol, bool up) =>
    offset = bar_index - atBar
    hi = high[offset]
    lo = low[offset]
    cl = close[offset]
    outer = f_tintA(baseCol, 0.55, T_SIGNAL)
    inner = f_tintA(baseCol, 0.0, T_SIGNAL)
    pad = atr * 0.6
    box.new(atBar - 1, hi + pad, atBar + 1, lo - pad, bgcolor = outer, border_color = color.new(baseCol, T_SIGNAL))
    box.new(atBar - 1, cl + atr * 0.15, atBar + 1, cl - atr * 0.15, bgcolor = inner, border_color = color.new(baseCol, T_SIGNAL), text = label_ + "\n" + f_boldNum(f_fmt(cl)), text_color = f_textOn(baseCol), text_size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT, text_halign = text.align_center)
    label.new(atBar, up ? lo - pad * 1.3 : hi + pad * 1.3, up ? "▲" : "▼", style = label.style_none, textcolor = baseCol, size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)

buySwingConfluence  = bullScore >= bearScore
sellSwingConfluence = bearScore >= bullScore

if barstate.isconfirmed and showEntryExitMarkers and inMarkerWindow and newLowPivotFlag and buySwingConfluence
    f_stampSignalAt(lastLowPivotBar, BOLD_ENTRY_BUY, colBuyArea, true)
if barstate.isconfirmed and showEntryExitMarkers and inMarkerWindow and newHighPivotFlag and sellSwingConfluence
    f_stampSignalAt(lastHighPivotBar, BOLD_EXIT_SELL, colSellArea, false)
if enableShort and barstate.isconfirmed and showEntryExitMarkers and inMarkerWindow and newHighPivotFlag and sellSwingConfluence
    f_stampSignalAt(lastHighPivotBar, BOLD_ENTRY_SELL, colSellArea, false)
if enableShort and barstate.isconfirmed and showEntryExitMarkers and inMarkerWindow and newLowPivotFlag and buySwingConfluence
    f_stampSignalAt(lastLowPivotBar, BOLD_EXIT_BUY, colBuyArea, true)

// Candlestick pattern name tag — only for specifically-named patterns
// (Engulfing/Hammer/Doji/Marubozu/etc.), not the generic Bullish/Bearish
// fallback, so the chart stays readable while still flagging real signals.
candleNameIsSpecific = candleNameCur != "Bullish" and candleNameCur != "Bearish"
// Only tag candles whose bias agrees with (or doesn't fight) the prevailing
// swing structure (SW) — i.e. the ones that actually matter to the swing
// trend read, not every named candle regardless of context.
candleAffectsSwing = (candleBiasCur == 1 and structureBias >= 0) or (candleBiasCur == -1 and structureBias <= 0)
if barstate.isconfirmed and showCandleTags and inMarkerWindow and candleNameIsSpecific and candleAffectsSwing
    tagCol = candleBiasCur == 1 ? bullCol : candleBiasCur == -1 ? bearCol : neutralCol
    label.new(bar_index, candleBiasCur == -1 ? high + atr * 0.2 : low - atr * 0.2, candleNameCur, style = candleBiasCur == -1 ? label.style_label_down : label.style_label_up, color = color.new(tagCol, T50), textcolor = f_textOn(tagCol), size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)

// ── Anomaly-Trap / Gradual Accumulation-Distribution markers — stamped once
// per fresh onset (not every bar the condition holds) so the chart doesn't
// flood. Anomaly sits on whichever side the spike came from; gradual
// accumulation sits below (buying-zone convention, like Entry-Buy) and
// gradual distribution sits above (selling-zone convention, like Exit-Sell).
f_stampAnomaly(string txt, color bgCol, bool placeAbove) =>
    yPos = placeAbove ? high + atr * 0.3 : low - atr * 0.3
    label.new(bar_index, yPos, txt, style = placeAbove ? label.style_label_down : label.style_label_up, color = color.new(bgCol, T_ANOMALY), textcolor = f_textOn(bgCol), size = 10, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)

if barstate.isconfirmed and showAnomalyMarkers and inMarkerWindow and anomalyTrapNew
    f_stampAnomaly(BOLD_ANOMALI_TRAP, color.red, anomalyWasUp)
if barstate.isconfirmed and showAnomalyMarkers and inMarkerWindow and gradualAccumNew
    f_stampAnomaly(BOLD_AKUMULASI_BERTAHAP + "\n" + BOLD_POTENSI_NAIK, color.green, false)
if barstate.isconfirmed and showAnomalyMarkers and inMarkerWindow and gradualDistNew
    f_stampAnomaly(BOLD_DISTRIBUSI_BERTAHAP + "\n" + BOLD_POTENSI_TURUN, color.red, true)

// ============================================================================
// LIVE CHART LAYER — status label, gradient level zones, live pattern
// preview. Cleared and redrawn every tick so the chart always reflects the
// CURRENT read; nothing here repaints history.
// ============================================================================
var label statusLbl = na
var array<line>     zoneLines  = array.new<line>()
var array<linefill> zoneFills  = array.new<linefill>()
var array<label>    zoneLabels = array.new<label>()
var array<box>      zoneBoxes  = array.new<box>()
var line  formingNeckLn = na
var label formingTagLbl = na
var line  trendProjLn  = na
var label trendProjLbl = na

f_clearLive() =>
    label.delete(statusLbl)
    line.delete(trendProjLn)
    label.delete(trendProjLbl)
    if array.size(zoneLines) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(zoneLines) - 1
            line.delete(array.get(zoneLines, i))
    array.clear(zoneLines)
    if array.size(zoneFills) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(zoneFills) - 1
            linefill.delete(array.get(zoneFills, i))
    array.clear(zoneFills)
    if array.size(zoneLabels) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(zoneLabels) - 1
            label.delete(array.get(zoneLabels, i))
    array.clear(zoneLabels)
    if array.size(zoneBoxes) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(zoneBoxes) - 1
            box.delete(array.get(zoneBoxes, i))
    array.clear(zoneBoxes)
    line.delete(formingNeckLn)
    label.delete(formingTagLbl)
    true

f_planLevel(int x1, int x2, float level, float halfWidthATR, color baseCol, string labelTxt) =>
    if not na(level)
        hw = atr * halfWidthATR
        centerCol = f_tint(baseCol, 0.0)
        midCol    = f_tint(baseCol, 0.35)
        lnMid = line.new(x1, level, x2, level, xloc = xloc.bar_time, color = centerCol, width = 2)
        lnUp  = line.new(x1, level + hw, x2, level + hw, xloc = xloc.bar_time, color = color.new(baseCol, 100))
        lnDn  = line.new(x1, level - hw, x2, level - hw, xloc = xloc.bar_time, color = color.new(baseCol, 100))
        lf1 = linefill.new(lnMid, lnUp, midCol)
        lf2 = linefill.new(lnMid, lnDn, midCol)
        lbl = label.new(x2, level, labelTxt, xloc = xloc.bar_time, style = label.style_label_left, color = centerCol, textcolor = f_textOn(baseCol), size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)
        array.push(zoneLines, lnMid)
        array.push(zoneLines, lnUp)
        array.push(zoneLines, lnDn)
        array.push(zoneFills, lf1)
        array.push(zoneFills, lf2)
        array.push(zoneLabels, lbl)

if barstate.islast
    f_clearLive()

    if showStatusLabel
        biasCol = trendBias >= 1 ? bullCol : trendBias <= -1 ? bearCol : neutralCol
        // Bandarmology read, folded straight into the Fase Volume line — only
        // shown when one of the three states actually reads true, so a quiet
        // bar doesn't clutter the panel with "Normal".
        bandarmologyText = isAnomalyTrap ? BOLD_ANOMALI_TRAP : gradualAccum ? BOLD_BERTAHAP_NAIK : gradualDist ? BOLD_BERTAHAP_TURUN : ""
        // AI Forecast price projection — keyed off the SAME aiYHatTrend flag
        // shown on the "AI Forecast:" line right above it, so the two always
        // agree: NAIK shows the forecast's highest projected price (% up from
        // realtime price) and H+ when it forms; TURUN shows the lowest
        // projected price (% down) and H+ likewise.
        aiProjText = "belum cukup data"
        float aiProjCeiling = na
        if showAIForecast and not na(aiYHat) and not na(curAiFcast)
            if aiYHatTrend
                pctMove = close != 0 ? (curAiFcast.projHigh - close) / close * 100 : 0.0
                pctSign = pctMove >= 0 ? "+" : ""
                aiProjText := "Tertinggi " + f_fmt(curAiFcast.projHigh) + " (" + pctSign + str.tostring(pctMove, "#.#") + "%) H+" + str.tostring(curAiFcast.projHighOffset)
                aiProjCeiling := curAiFcast.projHigh
            else
                pctMove = close != 0 ? (curAiFcast.projLow - close) / close * 100 : 0.0
                pctSign = pctMove >= 0 ? "+" : ""
                aiProjText := "Terendah " + f_fmt(curAiFcast.projLow) + " (" + pctSign + str.tostring(pctMove, "#.#") + "%) H+" + str.tostring(curAiFcast.projLowOffset)
        statusTxt = syminfo.ticker + " " + timeframe.period + "  |  IDXA PRO v6\n" +
                     "Trend: " + trendText + "   Struktur: " + structureText + "\n" +
                     "Fase Volume: " + phaseText + "   Regime ADX " + str.tostring(adx, "#.0") + " (" + regimeText + ")" + (bandarmologyText == "" ? "" : "  |  " + bandarmologyText) + "\n" +
                     "Pattern: " + patternName2 + (patternConfirmed2 ? " [confirmed]" : (bullForming or bearForming) ? " [forming]" : "") + "\n" +
                     "Action: " + action + "\n" +
                     "Grade: " + grade + "   Score Bull/Bear/Netral " + str.tostring(bullScore, "#") + "/" + str.tostring(bearScore, "#") + "/" + str.tostring(neutralScore, "#") + "\n" +
                     "AI Forecast: " + (not showAIForecast or na(aiYHat) ? "belum cukup data" : (aiYHatTrend ? "NAIK" : "TURUN") + " (conf " + str.tostring(nz(aiConf, 0) * 100, "#") + "%)") + "\n" +
                     "Prediksi Harga: " + aiProjText + "\n" +
                     "Win-rate: " + f_hitRateStr()
        levelCeiling = math.max(statusAnchorHigh, nz(resist1, statusAnchorHigh))
        levelCeiling := math.max(levelCeiling, nz(tp1Price, levelCeiling))
        levelCeiling := math.max(levelCeiling, nz(tp2Price, levelCeiling))
        levelCeiling := math.max(levelCeiling, nz(aiProjCeiling, levelCeiling))
        statusLbl := label.new(bar_index + 2, levelCeiling + atr * 3, statusTxt, style = label.style_label_down, color = color.new(biasCol, T50), textcolor = f_textOn(biasCol), size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)

    if showLevelZones
        planEndTime = time + planWeeks * 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000
        f_planLevel(time, planEndTime, support1, 0.35, colSupport, "SUPPORT  " + f_fmt(support1))
        f_planLevel(time, planEndTime, resist1, 0.35, colResist, "RESISTANCE  " + f_fmt(resist1))
        if activeDirection != 0
            f_planLevel(time, planEndTime, tp1Price, 0.30, colTP1, "TP1  " + f_fmt(tp1Price) + "  (RR 1:" + str.tostring(rr1, "#.##") + ")")
            f_planLevel(time, planEndTime, tp2Price, 0.30, colTP2, "TP2  " + f_fmt(tp2Price) + "  (RR 1:" + str.tostring(rr2, "#.##") + ")")
            f_planLevel(time, planEndTime, stopPrice, 0.30, colCutloss, "CUT LOSS  " + f_fmt(stopPrice))
        if showEntryZoneToday and activeDirection != 0
            zoneCol = activeLong ? colBuyArea : colSellArea
            outerZ = f_tint(zoneCol, 0.5)
            innerZ = f_tint(zoneCol, 0.0)
            zb1 = box.new(time, entryHigh, planEndTime, entryLow, xloc = xloc.bar_time, bgcolor = outerZ, border_color = color.new(zoneCol, T50))
            zb2 = box.new(time, entryHigh - (entryHigh - entryLow) * 0.3, planEndTime, entryLow + (entryHigh - entryLow) * 0.3, xloc = xloc.bar_time, bgcolor = innerZ, border_color = color.new(zoneCol, T50), text = (activeLong ? "ENTRY ZONE (BUY)  " : "ENTRY ZONE (SELL)  ") + f_fmt(entryLow) + "-" + f_fmt(entryHigh), text_color = f_textOn(zoneCol), text_size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)
            array.push(zoneBoxes, zb1)
            array.push(zoneBoxes, zb2)

    if showTrendLine
        tfSecondsPerBar = timeframe.in_seconds()
        barsPerWeek = tfSecondsPerBar > 0 ? math.max(1, int((7 * 24 * 60 * 60) / tfSecondsPerBar)) : 5
        trendFwdBars = trendLineFwdWeeks * barsPerWeek
        trendX1 = bar_index - trendLineLen + 1
        trendY2 = trendLineReg0 + trendLineSlope * trendFwdBars
        trendCol = trendLineSlope >= 0 ? bullCol : bearCol
        trendProjLn := line.new(trendX1, trendLineRegPrev, bar_index + trendFwdBars, trendY2, color = color.new(trendCol, T50), style = line.style_dashed, width = 3)
        trendProjLbl := label.new(bar_index + trendFwdBars, trendY2, "TREND PROJECTION\n" + (trendLineSlope >= 0 ? "▲ NAIK" : "▼ TURUN") + "  " + f_boldNum(f_fmt(trendY2)), style = trendLineSlope >= 0 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color = color.new(trendCol, T50), textcolor = f_textOn(trendCol), size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)

    if showPatternShape
        formingP = f_mostRecentForming()
        if not na(formingP)
            neckNowPreview = f_neckAt(formingP, bar_index)
            previewCol = neutralCol
            formingNeckLn := line.new(formingP.coreS, f_neckAt(formingP, formingP.coreS), bar_index, neckNowPreview, color = color.new(previewCol, T50), style = line.style_dashed, width = 1)
            formingTagLbl := label.new(bar_index, neckNowPreview, f_name(formingP.kind) + " (forming, belum konfirmasi)", style = formingP.dir == -1 ? label.style_label_down : label.style_label_up, color = color.new(previewCol, T50), textcolor = f_textOn(previewCol), size = txtSize, text_font_family = TXT_FONT)

// ============================================================================
// ALERTS
// ============================================================================
patternJustConfirmedBull = bullConf
patternJustConfirmedBear = bearConf
swingBuySignal = newLowPivotFlag and buySwingConfluence
swingSellSignal = newHighPivotFlag and sellSwingConfluence
anySignal = newLong or newExit or swingBuySignal or swingSellSignal or (enableShort and (newShort or newShortCover)) or (bullBreakout and breakoutVolumeOK) or falseBullBreak or falseBearBreak

alertcondition(anySignal, "IDXA PRO v6 — Any Signal", "IDXA PRO v6 signal on {{ticker}} at {{close}}. Open chart for details.")
alertcondition(swingBuySignal, "IDXA PRO v6 — Swing ENTRY-BUY", "{{ticker}} swing-low ENTRY-BUY at {{close}}")
alertcondition(swingSellSignal, "IDXA PRO v6 — Swing EXIT-SELL", "{{ticker}} swing-high EXIT-SELL at {{close}}")
alertcondition(newLong, "IDXA PRO v6 — ENTRY - BUY", "{{ticker}} ENTRY - BUY at {{close}}")
alertcondition(newExit, "IDXA PRO v6 — EXIT - SELL", "{{ticker}} EXIT - SELL at {{close}}")
alertcondition(newShort, "IDXA PRO v6 — ENTRY - SELL", "{{ticker}} ENTRY - SELL at {{close}}")
alertcondition(newShortCover, "IDXA PRO v6 — EXIT - BUY", "{{ticker}} EXIT - BUY at {{close}}")
alertcondition(bullBreakout and breakoutVolumeOK, "IDXA PRO v6 — Valid Breakout", "Valid resistance breakout with volume on {{ticker}} at {{close}}")
alertcondition(falseBullBreak, "IDXA PRO v6 — Bull Trap Risk", "Thin/weak bullish breakout on {{ticker}} at {{close}}")
alertcondition(falseBearBreak, "IDXA PRO v6 — Bear Trap Risk", "Thin/weak bearish breakdown on {{ticker}} at {{close}}")
alertcondition(patternJustConfirmedBull, "IDXA PRO v6 — Bullish Pattern Confirmed", "Bullish pattern confirmed on {{ticker}} at {{close}}")
alertcondition(patternJustConfirmedBear, "IDXA PRO v6 — Bearish Pattern Confirmed", "Bearish pattern confirmed on {{ticker}} at {{close}}")
alertcondition(tgtHit, "IDXA PRO v6 — Pattern Target Reached", "A confirmed pattern reached its measured target on {{ticker}} at {{close}}")
alertcondition(patFail, "IDXA PRO v6 — Pattern Invalidated", "A confirmed pattern was invalidated on {{ticker}} at {{close}}")

// ============================================================================
// AI FORECAST — continuous regime-band plots (kept from the original script,
// unchanged in style: these are ordinary series plots, not drawing objects,
// so they need no manual cleanup).
// ============================================================================
aiPlotL = plot(showAIForecast ? aiLMin : na, color = colSellArea, style = plot.style_linebr, title = "AI Forecast Min")
aiPlotH = plot(showAIForecast ? aiHMax : na, color = colBuyArea, style = plot.style_linebr, title = "AI Forecast Max")
aiPlotM = plot(showAIForecast and bar_index % 3 == 0 ? aiMMid : na, color = chart.fg_color, style = plot.style_linebr, title = "AI Forecast Mid")
fill(aiPlotM, aiPlotH, aiHMax, aiMMid, color.new(colBuyArea, 90), na)
fill(aiPlotM, aiPlotL, aiMMid, aiLMin, na, color.new(colSellArea, 90))
plot(showAIForecast ? aiYHatLine : na, title = "AI Forecast Predicted Value", color = nz(aiYHatSmooth, 0) >= 0 ? color.new(colBuyArea, 20) : color.new(colSellArea, 20))

// ============================================================================
// DATA WINDOW — for screening/debugging, never drawn on the chart
// ============================================================================
plot(bullScore, "Bull Score", display = display.data_window)
plot(bearScore, "Bear Score", display = display.data_window)
plot(neutralScore, "Neutral Score", display = display.data_window)
plot(adx, "ADX", display = display.data_window)
plot(rvol, "Relative Volume", display = display.data_window)
plot(cmf, "CMF (Akumulasi/Distribusi)", display = display.data_window)
plot(velocity, "Price Velocity (ROC %)", display = display.data_window)
plot(avgValueM, "Avg Traded Value (M)", display = display.data_window)
plot(atrPct, "ATR %", display = display.data_window)
plot(anySignal ? 1 : 0, "Any Signal", display = display.data_window)
plot(aiConf, "AI Forecast Confidence", display = display.data_window)
plot(aiYHatTrend ? 1 : 0, "AI Forecast Trend Up", display = display.data_window)
